# Files excluded from the Docker build context. Keeps the COPY layers
# small, speeds up builds, and prevents secrets from leaking into images.

# Dependencies installed inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build artifacts (re-created during the docker build)
**/dist
**/.next
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Python caches (apps/ml — not deployed, but excluded for safety)
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache

# Local state and editor scratch
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Environment files — secrets are injected via env, never baked in
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Repo-local docs / sample data that aren't part of the runtime
prototype
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf
*.md
!apps/ml/README.md

# Test output
**/junit.xml
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
